WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:18.682
Jason walked into Kids Central and sat down between Bobby and Nina.

2
00:00:18.683 --> 00:00:24.339
"Ah-choo!" Jason held a tissue to his nose.

3
00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:28.008
"Do you have a cold, Jason?" Miss Shelly asked.

4
00:00:28.009 --> 00:00:30.481
"No." Jason shrugged.

5
00:00:30.482 --> 00:00:33.330
"But sometimes cats make me sneeze."

6
00:00:33.331 --> 00:00:38.460
"There are no cats in here!" Bobby said. "Just people."

7
00:00:38.461 --> 00:00:41.854
"Ah-choo!" Jason sneezed again.

8
00:00:41.855 --> 00:00:45.108
Nina handed him another tissue.

9
00:00:45.109 --> 00:00:50.089
"We're playing a game called twenty questions today," Miss Shelly said.

10
00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:53.462
"Jason, do you want to be 'it'?"

11
00:00:53.463 --> 00:00:57.593
"Sure." Jason nodded, and blew his nose.

12
00:00:57.594 --> 00:00:59.755
"Good," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:00:59.756 --> 00:01:03.020
"Think of a person, place, or thing.

14
00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:06.383
Everyone else will try to guess what it is."

15
00:01:06.384 --> 00:01:08.944
"Hmm," Jason thought.

16
00:01:08.945 --> 00:01:11.871
"I could choose a person."

17
00:01:11.872 --> 00:01:15.028
He thought of Ms. Folani and George Washington.

18
00:01:15.029 --> 00:01:17.034
But they seemed too easy.

19
00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:21.421
"Maybe I'll choose a place like Africa or Pauly's Pizza.

20
00:01:21.422 --> 00:01:27.551
Or . . ." He sneezed loudly. "Okay, I'm ready."

21
00:01:27.552 --> 00:01:30.387
Miss Shelly nodded and looked at the other kids.

22
00:01:30.388 --> 00:01:34.174
"Jason is thinking of a person, place, or thing.

23
00:01:34.175 --> 00:01:38.343
You can ask him yes or no questions about it."

24
00:01:38.344 --> 00:01:43.445
"We can only ask twenty questions, right?" Izzie asked.

25
00:01:43.446 --> 00:01:47.123
"Right!" Miss Shelly said with a smile.

26
00:01:47.124 --> 00:01:50.164
She handed Nina some paper and a pencil.

27
00:01:50.165 --> 00:01:54.369
"Nina will record how many questions you ask."

28
00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:57.034
"I'm first!" Bobby said.

29
00:01:57.035 --> 00:02:01.045
"Jason, is it a person, a place, or a thing?"

30
00:02:01.046 --> 00:02:05.168
"You can't ask that, Bobby," Izzie said.

31
00:02:05.169 --> 00:02:09.882
"Jason can only answer yes or no questions."

32
00:02:09.883 --> 00:02:15.194
"Oh yeah." Bobby tried again. "Is it a person?"

33
00:02:15.195 --> 00:02:19.073
"No," Jason said.

34
00:02:19.074 --> 00:02:22.149
"Is it a thing?" Izzie asked.

35
00:02:22.150 --> 00:02:24.915
"Ah-choo! No."

36
00:02:24.916 --> 00:02:28.819
"Two questions so far," Nina said.

37
00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:32.550
"So it's a place," Ethan said.

38
00:02:32.551 --> 00:02:35.100
"Is it in Pennsylvania?"

39
00:02:35.101 --> 00:02:37.250
"Yes."

40
00:02:37.251 --> 00:02:40.945
"Is it in our town?" Nina asked.

41
00:02:40.946 --> 00:02:43.259
"Yes."

42
00:02:43.260 --> 00:02:46.117
"Is it outside?" Bobby asked.

43
00:02:46.118 --> 00:02:48.707
"Ah-choo! Nope."

44
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:52.788
"Hmm." Izzie tapped her chin.

45
00:02:52.789 --> 00:02:55.417
"Have we all been there?"

46
00:02:55.418 --> 00:02:56.816
"Yes."

47
00:02:56.817 --> 00:02:59.622
Ethan was next.

48
00:02:59.623 --> 00:03:01.801
"Do we like to go there?"

49
00:03:01.802 --> 00:03:04.133
"Yes."

50
00:03:04.134 --> 00:03:08.638
"Does the place have tables?" Nina asked.

51
00:03:08.639 --> 00:03:11.729
"Yes," Jason said.

52
00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:14.380
Nina looked at her sheet of paper.

53
00:03:14.381 --> 00:03:16.525
"That's eight questions.

54
00:03:16.526 --> 00:03:19.332
We have twelve more left."

55
00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:24.380
"I know!" Bobby cried. "Is it Kids Central?"

56
00:03:24.381 --> 00:03:26.708
"No," said Jason.

57
00:03:26.709 --> 00:03:29.576
Bobby looked grumpy.

58
00:03:29.577 --> 00:03:33.273
"Is the place at school?" asked Izzie.

59
00:03:33.274 --> 00:03:35.737
"Yes! Ah-choo!"

60
00:03:35.738 --> 00:03:40.891
Ethan's stomach growled. "Is it the cafeteria?"

61
00:03:40.892 --> 00:03:43.833
"Yes!" Jason said.

62
00:03:43.834 --> 00:03:47.227
"Ethan guessed correctly," Miss Shelly said.

63
00:03:47.228 --> 00:03:51.195
"So he gets to be 'it' next."

64
00:03:51.196 --> 00:03:54.629
"I have to sharpen this pencil," Nina said.

65
00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:59.689
She got up to get her pencil sharpener.

66
00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:03.804
As she opened her backpack, she gasped.

67
00:04:03.805 --> 00:04:07.407
"Oh no! Guess what I found!"

68
00:04:07.408 --> 00:04:10.239
"Ah-choo! Ah-choo!"

69
00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:13.865
"Does it make Jason sneeze?" Izzie asked.

70
00:04:13.866 --> 00:04:17.529
"Yes!" Nina said.

71
00:04:17.530 --> 00:04:20.137
"Is it fuzzy?" Ethan said.

72
00:04:20.138 --> 00:04:22.768
"Yes!" said Nina.

73
00:04:22.769 --> 00:04:25.139
"Ah-choo!"

74
00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:27.797
"Is it a cat?" Bobby asked.

75
00:04:27.798 --> 00:04:33.401
"No," Nina said. "But it belongs to a cat."

76
00:04:33.402 --> 00:04:36.753
"Let's see, Nina," Miss Shelly said.

77
00:04:36.754 --> 00:04:39.852
Nina pulled something from her backpack.

78
00:04:39.853 --> 00:04:45.252
"Ah-choo! Ah-choo!" Jason sneezed and sneezed.

79
00:04:45.253 --> 00:04:49.160
"It's my cat's brush," Nina said.

80
00:04:49.161 --> 00:04:53.409
"Let's get it outside quickly," Miss Shelly said.

81
00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:57.052
Nina hurried to put the brush outside.

82
00:04:57.053 --> 00:04:59.592
Then she ran over to Jason.

83
00:04:59.593 --> 00:05:02.068
"I'm so sorry, Jason!"

84
00:05:02.069 --> 00:05:04.278
He blew his nose.

85
00:05:04.279 --> 00:05:06.333
"I'm glad you found it.

86
00:05:06.334 --> 00:05:13.061
Otherwise I could have sneezed all afternoon!"
